        "details": "Passing evidence record for SEC-05-BIN-SEC exists in ledger, but hard prerequisite SEC-03-MEM-MGMT is unfulfilled. Triple verification: intrinsic evaluation is SATISFIED, but curricular status is strictly LOCKED, and unfulfilled_hard_prerequisites contains SEC-03-MEM-MGMT."
      },
